{"id":"vod_sn_38756","vodId":"38756","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士V3","name_cn":"假面骑士V3","date":"1973-01-01","year":"1973","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/da0f20a0a586a4b5cdb9805928553464.jpg"},"summary":"由于两位假面骑士的活跃，邪恶组织·杰鲁修卡被消灭，但是首领又创建了新组织·毒蝎帮(又译“迪斯特龙”)。本乡猛的学弟·风见志郎偶然目击毒蝎帮的行动，而受到该邪恶组织的追杀，之后父母以及妹妹都被毒蝎帮的怪人所杀。志郎为了向毒蝎帮军复仇而要求1号和2号替他改造，但二人知道改造人的悲哀，而拒绝了他。后来1号和2号落入了毒蝎帮的陷阱而陷入危机，志郎舍命相救，被机关所伤而奄奄一息，为了救他一命，1号、2号不得不将他改造成改造人·假面骑士V3。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/502W1R8MDP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9CSxcgnUp01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iMBLm58zbv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iyxWxevjb21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sgnX2L5Bjm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sfu0ysG8571/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RqTJNhxwMh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uZbbzheWJ21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qchMUFVB7P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H5Lt9CiieM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KakPF7hBGG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rgWd7uXYge1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1Y5hJzrMSh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fMunvzrS4H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4D2bkykDtw1/video/index.m3u8